[0.0, "o", "ints for inventory CRUD, quick stock steppers, project BOM\r\n  management, part allocation/reservation, consumption into builds, build logs, and shopping list aggregation.\r\n  • \u001b[1mFrontend UI & Styles\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9f4284af5bed0d48;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/index.html\u0007index.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk226a90cdb58cd19f;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/styles.css\u0007styles.css\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkecf96e69ee2d98d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/app.js\u0007app.js\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### What's Included\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mComponents Inventory (\u001b[94;22mOn Hand\u001b[39;1m vs. \u001b[94;22mAllocated\u001b[39;1m vs. \u001b[94;22mAvailable\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[58D• Tailored categories and footprints for Eurorack & guitar pedals (\u001b[94mSMD 0603\u001b[m/\u001b[94m0805\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTHT Axial 1/4W\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSSOP-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m16\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAlpha 9mm Vertical\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAlpha 16mm PCB"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[m, \u001b[94mThonkiconn\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3PDT\u001b[m, \u001b[94m125B Enclosure\u001b[m).\n\u001b[74D• Tracks storage locations/bins, supplier & SKU (\u001b[94mMouser\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTayda\u001b[m, \u001b[94mThonk\u001b[m, \u001b[94mStompBoxParts\u001b[m), unit cost, and low-stock\r\n\u001b[6Calert thresholds.\n\u001b[17D• Instant filtering by search query, category, footprint type (\u001b[94mSMD\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTHT\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPanel & Hardware\u001b[m), and stock status\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mLow Available\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCurrently Allocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mZero Available\u001b[m).\r\n  2. \u001b[1mDIY Kit Builds & Part Allocation\u001b[m:\n\u001b[32D• Track build stages (\u001b[94mPlanning\u001b[m, \u001b[94mParts Ordered\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReady to Build\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSoldering\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTesting & Calibration\u001b[m,\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mTroubleshooting / On Hold\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCompleted\u001b[m).\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[1mReserve / Allocate Parts\u001b[m: Allocate parts per BOM line or click \u001b[1mAllocate All Available Parts\u001b[m to reserve parts\r\n\u001b[6Cinto a project's kit baggie (reducing \u001b[94mAvailable\u001b[m stock without deducting \u001b[94mTotal On Hand\u001b[m).\n\u001b[87D• \u001b[1mSolder / Consume Parts\u001b[m: Interactive soldering checklist"]
