[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  • \u001b[1mBackend API Server\u001b[m: \u001b]8;id=jk11d02930ebc3e6f7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/server.js\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mv\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mj\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ — Express endpoints for inventory CRUD, quick stock steppers, project BOM\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  management, part allocation/reservation, consumption into builds, build logs, and shopping list aggregation.\r\n  • \u001b[1mFrontend UI & Styles\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5ab0d07685a830b7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/index.html\u0007index.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4026672d50cfde94;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/styles.css\u0007styles.css\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd9e5f307b9277aa6;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/app.js\u0007app.js\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### What's Included\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mComponents Inv"]
[0.0, "o", "entory (\u001b[94;22mOn Hand\u001b[39;1m vs. \u001b[94;22mAllocated\u001b[39;1m vs. \u001b[94;22mAvailable\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[58D• Tailored categories and footprints for Eurorack & guitar pedals (\u001b[94mSMD 0603\u001b[m/\u001b[94m0805\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTHT Axial 1/4W\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSSOP-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m16\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAlpha 9mm Vertical\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAlpha 16mm PCB\u001b[m, \u001b[94mThonkiconn\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3PDT\u001b[m, \u001b[94m125B Enclosure\u001b[m).\n\u001b[74D• Tracks storage locations/bins, supplier & SKU (\u001b[94mMouser\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTayda\u001b[m, \u001b[94mThonk\u001b[m, \u001b[94mStompBoxParts\u001b[m), unit cost, and low-stock\r\n\u001b[6Calert thresholds.\n\u001b[17D• Instant filtering by search query, category, footprint type (\u001b[94mSMD\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTHT\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPanel & Hardware\u001b[m), and stock status\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mLow Available\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCurrently Allocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mZero Available\u001b[m).\r\n  2. \u001b[1mDIY Kit Builds & Part Allocation\u001b[m:\n\u001b[32D• Track build stages (\u001b[94mPlanning\u001b[m, \u001b[94mParts Ordered\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReady to Build\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSoldering\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTesting & Calibration\u001b[m,\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mTroubleshooting / On Hold\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCompleted\u001b["]
[0.0, "o", "m).\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[1mReserve / Allocate Parts\u001b[m: Allocate parts per BOM line or click \u001b[1mAllocate All Available Parts\u001b[m to reserve parts\r\n\u001b[6Cinto a project's kit baggie (reducing \u001b[94mAvailable\u001b[m stock without deducting \u001b[94mTotal On Hand\u001b[m).\n\u001b[87D• \u001b[1mSolder / Consume Parts\u001b[m: Interactive soldering checklist per BOM line, plus \u001b[1mSolder / Consume Allocated Parts\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cto permanently deduct allocated parts from \u001b[94mOn Hand\u001b[m stock when installed.\n\u001b[72D• \u001b[1mBench Build Logs\u001b[m: Log timestamped notes for calibration (e.g., 1V/Oct tracking, diode V_f matching,\r\n\u001b[6Ctransistor biasing), modifications, or troubleshooting.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mOrder List / Shortages & CSV Import/Export\u001b[m:\n\u001b[42D• Aggregates unallocated BOM shortfalls across all active builds alongside low-stock restock alerts, grouped\r\n\u001b[6Cand filtera\r\n\n⣟  \u001b[90mGenerating.\u001b[94m..\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
