[29.918, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27Aproperty to the \u001b[94mhtml\u001b[m element or the \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m pseudo-class\").\u001b[K\n\u001b[55D\u001b[94mdark-mode-toggle\u001b[m: I mapped \u001b[94m<meta name=\"color-scheme\">\u001b[m overrides back to \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m via \u001b[94m:has()\u001b[m and implemented a two-\r\n\u001b[4Cate toggle that removes the \u001b[94mlocalStorage\u001b[m entry when returning to the system preference (\"Since \u001b[94mdark-mode\u001b[m ... sets\r\n  \u001b[94mcolor-scheme: light dark\u001b[m on \u001b[94m:root\u001b[m, updating the \u001b[94m<meta>\u001b[m alone is a \u001b[1mno-op\u001b[m — CSS wins\u001b[2P\n\u001b[80D\u001b[94mvalidate-input-after-interaction\u001b[m: I styled invalid inputs using \u001b[94m:user-invalid\u001b[m with a \u001b[94mWeakMap\u001b[m interaction fallback\r\n  and \u001b[94maria-invalid\u001b[m synchronization on \u001b[94mblur\u001b[m and \u001b[94minput\u001b[m so errors never fire prematurely before user interaction (\"Use\r\n  \u001b[94m:user-invalid\u001b[m to apply error styling only after interaction\").\n\u001b[60D\u001b[94mforms\u001b[m: I placed visible \u001b[94m<label>\u001b[m and \u001b[94maria-describedby\u001b[m hints above inputs and disabled text auto-correction on part\r\n  numbers, SKUs, and sear"]
[0.0, "o", "ch fields (\"DO turn off text correction on fields that hold identifiers rather than prose:\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mautocorrect=\"off\"\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94mautocapitalize=\"off\"\u001b[m and \u001b[94mspellcheck=\"false\"\u001b[m)\").\u001b[K\n\u001b[69D\u001b[94mhtml\u001b[m: I used \u001b[94m<search>\u001b[m for the inventory filter bar and native \u001b[94m<button>\u001b[m elements with \u001b[94maddEventListener()\u001b[m rather\u001b[K\r\n  than inline event handlers (\"DO use \u001b[94m<search>\u001b[m to enclose search and filtering mechanisms (eliminates the need for\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mrole=\"search\"\u001b[m)\").\u001b[K\n\u001b[15D\u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized styles into \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities\u001b[m, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button\u001b[K\r\n  hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing\u001b[m resets with \u001b[94m:where()\u001b[m instead of a universal \u001b[94m*\u001b[m selector (\"DO NOT use global\u001b[K\r\n  resets (styles on \u001b[94m*\u001b[m) as they cannot be overridden by web components or lower-priority cascade layers\").\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[94maccessibility\u001b[m: I added a \u001b[94m.visually-hidden\u001b[m skip link targeting \u001b[94m<h1 id=\"main-heading\" tabindex="]
[0.0, "o", "\"-1\">\u001b[m, disambiguated\r\n  row action buttons with accessible labels, and centralized status announcements in a single \u001b[94maria-live=\"polite\"\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  region (\"If an element can receive keyboard focus, it must not be hidden via \u001b[94maria-hidden=\"true\"\u001b[m\").\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m /\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94"]
