[0.0, "o", "ventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/app.js#L156-L167\u0007announceStatus\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (plus a global \u001b[94munhandledrejection\u001b[m listener) to announce and style API errors\r\n      via \u001b[94m.toast-region.is-error\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\tFixed \u001b[94m#bom-table\u001b[m stacked mobile labels (\u001b[94m--label-1: \"Soldered\"\u001b[m) and added \u001b[94morder: -1\u001b[m on \u001b[94mtbody th\u001b[m in\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2dec3bc1cf8b999c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_baseline/public/styles.css#L678-L744\u0007styles.css:678-744\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so the designator header stays at the top of each mobile card.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Modern Web Guidance\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mresponsive-table\u001b[m: Aligned \u001b[94m#bom-table\u001b[m's \u001b[94m--label-1\u001b[m through \u001b[94m--label-10\u001b[m custom properties with its leading checkbox\r\n  \u001b[94m<td>\u001b[m and ordered \u001b[94mtbody th\u001b[m first in the \u001b[94m< 680px\u001b[m container query so the sticky row header remains at the top of each\r\n  stacked card without shifting column labels (\"/* MANDATORY: Map the label for each column"]
